       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-STANAG-DIRECT-RESIDUAL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-STANAG-RESIDUAL-BOUNDS.
           05  WS-DIRECT-STANAG-ROUTING-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-LATENCY-SKIP-CONN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-4586-PACKET-FUSION-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SCSI-CHANNEL18-DETENT-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NO-CONV-SHATTER-LOSS     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-STANAG-RESIDUAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-STANAG-RESNET-PROVEN     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-STANAG-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-PACKET-RESIDUALS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SCSI-STANAG-FUSION.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-STANAG-RESNET.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-PACKET-RESIDUALS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIRECT-STANAG-ROUTING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-LATENCY-SKIP-CONN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-CONV-SHATTER-LOSS.
       2000-EVALUATE-SCSI-STANAG-FUSION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-4586-PACKET-FUSION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SCSI-CHANNEL18-DETENT-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-STANAG-RESNET.
           IF WS-DIRECT-STANAG-ROUTING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-LATENCY-SKIP-CONN = 1 AND
              WS-4586-PACKET-FUSION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SCSI-CHANNEL18-DETENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-NO-CONV-SHATTER-LOSS = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-STANAG-RESNET-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-STANAG-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-STANAG-RESNET-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-STANAG-CODE.
